o"}],"full_text":"Targetfind is a spell used to enhance missiles, making them able to locate specific targets by sight. It appears as an orange-red aura produced from the user's hand which then surrounds the projectiles.\n\nHistory\n\nWilder's Suits used Targetfind on their combat chopper's missiles, in an attempt to take out the Huntik team before they could land and reach the Tower of Nostradamus. [The Tower of Nostradamus]\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Trouve-cible\nPortuguese: Alvo-detecção","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E28 Targetfind.png‎\n| aura  = Red <br> Yellow\n| class = Utility\n| first = \"[[The Tower of Nostradamus]]\"\n| users = [[Suits]]<br>[[Unnamed Suit 055]]<br>[[Unnamed Suit 058]]\n}}\n'''Targetfind''' is a spell used to enhance missiles, making them able to locate specific targets by sight. It appears as an orange-red aura produced from the user's hand which then surrounds the projectiles.\n\n== History ==\n[[Wilder]]'s [[Suits]] used Targetfind on their [[The Organization's combat choppers|combat chopper]]'s missiles, in an attempt to take out the [[Huntik]] team before they could land and reach the [[Tower of Nostradamus]]. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Trouve-cible\n|POR=Alvo-detecção}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Utility spells]]","categories":["Magic","Organization magic","Red-aura spells","Utility spells","Yellow-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:6963","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Tower of Nostradamus","label":"The Tower of Nostradamus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Tower_of_Nostradamus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A6963"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage